# Phase 1: Complete Character Production Plan



Design direction approved

Prequel · Chapter 1



Our first production milestone is to replace the current procedural character with a believable, cinematic human character who can carry the emotional weight of the Prequel.

The visual benchmark is The Last of Us Part II, particularly its character realism, facial performance, animation, clothing and cinematic presentation. We will create an original character, not copy an existing character or use Harsha's photographs.

The guiding principle:

Harsha should feel like a real person walking through a real neighbourhood, not a 3D model moving through a game scene.

