## 1.1 Overall appearance

| Attribute          | Design direction                                          |
| ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- |
| Character identity | Original fictional character                              |
| Age appearance     | Young adult                                               |
| Face               | Natural, realistic proportions                            |
| Eyes               | Detailed eyes with realistic reflections and eye movement |
| Skin               | Natural skin texture, subtle imperfections                |
| Hair               | Detailed hairstyle with individual-looking strands        |
| Body               | Realistic human proportions                               |
| Posture            | Natural, relaxed, slightly expressive                     |
| Movement           | Grounded, human-like                                      |
