# 9. Technical implementation

The proposed production pipeline:

01\. Blender character production

Primary asset

Model, topology, clothing, hair, rigging, facial controls and animation clips.

02\. GLB export

Export the character, skeleton, materials and animation clips in a Three.js-compatible format.

03\. Three.js integration

Load the GLB using GLTFLoader, control animation through AnimationMixer, and connect actions to the existing state machine.

04\. Character performance system

Animation blending, IK, eye tracking, facial expressions, phone interaction and secondary motion.

05\. Cinematic integration

Shot-specific lighting, framing, animation timing and character-camera synchronization.

